<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net8.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <PackageId>Talaan</PackageId>
    <Version>0.2.0</Version>
    <Authors>BaryoDev</Authors>
    <Description>A zero-dependency spreadsheet and CSV reader for .NET. Reads .xlsx (OOXML) and CSV into a simple typed cell grid, no Interop, no ClosedXML, no OpenXML SDK.</Description>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MPL-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageTags>xlsx;csv;spreadsheet;excel;parser;zero-dependency;import</PackageTags>

    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/BaryoDev/Talaan</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/BaryoDev/Talaan</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>

    <PackageReleaseNotes>0.2.0
Behaviour changes:
- An unterminated quoted field in CSV now throws InvalidDataException instead of reading to the end of the file.
- Any malformed or DTD-bearing XML part in an .xlsx now throws InvalidDataException naming the part, with the XmlException as InnerException. Catch InvalidDataException for any bad file.
- Cell references past column XFD and row numbers past 1048576 throw InvalidDataException.

Fixes:
- DTD processing is prohibited on every workbook XML part (entity expansion and external entities).
- Rows missing from sheetData no longer shift later rows up.
- Workbooks using the 1904 date system no longer read dates 1462 days early.
- Phonetic runs (rPh) are no longer added to string text.
- CsvReader.Read leaves the caller's stream open.
- CellValue.AsString keeps the time for dates that have one.

New:
- Encoding overloads for CSV: CsvReader.Read(Stream, Encoding, char), Spreadsheet.Read(Stream, SpreadsheetFormat, Encoding) and Spreadsheet.ReadFile(string, Encoding).
- The package links the repository and ships the readme, icon and symbols.</PackageReleaseNotes>

    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageIcon>icon.png</PackageIcon>

    <Deterministic>true</Deterministic>
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild Condition="'$(GITHUB_ACTIONS)' == 'true'">true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\assets\icon.png" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
